registry.json
# concepts/ is a generated artifact (Phase 5, D-04/D-05): build-registry.mjs
# materializes concept bodies here alongside registry.json, and the GitHub Action
# commits the tree cross-repo into okfhub-website/public/concepts/. Like
# registry.json, it is regenerated fresh on every build — never hand-authored here.
concepts/
# graphs.json is a generated artifact (Phase 10, D-03): build-registry.mjs emits
